# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lead notifications (Resend — https://resend.com)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Setup (about 5 minutes):
#   1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
#   2. Create an API key (API Keys → Create), copy it.
#   3. Copy this file to ".env.local" and paste the key into RESEND_API_KEY below.
#   4. Restart the dev server.
#
# Sending addresses:
#   • Before verifying a domain, Resend only lets you send FROM "onboarding@resend.dev"
#     and only TO the email you signed up with. So set LEAD_NOTIFY_TO to that email to test.
#   • After you verify clientgrowth.ca in Resend (Domains → Add), change LEAD_FROM to
#     something like "Client Growth <audits@clientgrowth.ca>" and LEAD_NOTIFY_TO to juan@clientgrowth.ca.
#
# On Vercel: add these same three variables under Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

RESEND_API_KEY=
LEAD_NOTIFY_TO=juan@clientgrowth.ca
LEAD_FROM=Client Growth <onboarding@resend.dev>
